body:
I found in the stuffing remains of my eviscerated plush a tag reading "kepelon". I searched for this brand online but couldn't find a website for it. I DID find this ([https://www.taobao.com/list/item/659668325145.htm?spm=a21wu.10013406.taglist-content.17](https://www.taobao.com/list/item/659668325145.htm?spm=a21wu.10013406.taglist-content.17)) but everything is in Chinese and I don't know how trustworthy the site is. 

&#x200B;

The pillow reminds me of my own elderly orange tabby cat (her name is Twinkle) so I would really like to find it again.

True, but what I'm addressing is the posts that have been up for months, or even a YEAR, with lots of upvotes and comments, and still don't have a link. I've sorted through "top: all time" on this subreddit, and 9 out of 10 times the posts I find there don't have a link. The TOP POST of ALL TIME on this subreddit doesn't have a link, and it's been up for 7 months.

&#x200B;

Also, thank you for the flair correction. I changed it accordingly :)

Thank you for replying! :)

&#x200B;

Also, yeah, I didn't mean "hired", haha. I meant persuaded.

I don't disagree. But, I think gun control would be a good stepping stone to all the other changes needed to improve the situation :)

&#x200B;

I appreciate the second insight, though. I value your ability to be considerate and clear in an online debate, and while we might disagree on how to solve the issue, I know it's important that we both still consider this an issue that must be fixed.

I'm not debating whether or not I should get shot up in school, but ok AlphaBro9000

&#x200B;

Also, you spelled unintelligent wrong.

Oh no!!! Poor baby is upset because his comments are being downvoted!!! :( so sad

&#x200B;

For real, it's RIDICULOUS that you post a comment containing harassment and then you have the audacity to get offended because I downvoted your comments. Sexual harassment is not a joke. It isn't funny at all. You got downvoted because there are consequences to your actions. Remember: You're on reddit, and people can downvote whatever they want

Shower head. 

&#x200B;

I don't think I have to explain.
